<div class="reu-policy__section" id="pre-order-cancellations">
  <h2>1. Pre-Order Cancellations</h2>
  <p>You may request cancellation of an unshipped pre-order by contacting REÚ with your order number.</p>
  <p>Approved cancellations of unshipped pre-orders will receive a full refund to the original payment method.</p>
  <p>Once an order has shipped, the return conditions described below apply.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="eligible-returns">
  <h2>2. Eligible Returns</h2>
  <p>Because REÚ products are ingestible wellness supplements, eligible returns must be unopened, unused, undamaged and in their original sealed packaging.</p>
  <p>Proof of purchase is required.</p>
  <p>The final return-request period must be confirmed by the merchant and displayed here before launch.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="opened-products">
  <h2>3. Opened Products</h2>
  <p>Opened supplements cannot normally be returned because of health, hygiene and product-safety considerations.</p>
  <p>This does not affect rights that customers may have when a product is defective, damaged, incorrect or otherwise covered by applicable consumer law.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="damaged-or-incorrect-orders">
  <h2>4. Damaged or Incorrect Orders</h2>
  <p>If your order arrives damaged, defective or incorrect, contact REÚ as soon as possible through the <a href="{{ pages.contact.url | default: '/pages/contact' }}">Contact page</a>.</p>
  <p>Please provide:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your order number</li>
    <li>A description of the issue</li>
    <li>Clear photographs of the product</li>
    <li>Photographs of the shipping packaging and label when relevant</li>
  </ul>
  <p>After reviewing the information, we may provide an appropriate replacement, store credit or refund.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="non-returnable-items">
  <h2>5. Non-Returnable Items</h2>
  <p>Unless otherwise required by law, the following items are not eligible for return:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Opened or used supplements</li>
    <li>Products without original packaging</li>
    <li>Gift cards</li>
    <li>Items marked final sale where legally permitted</li>
    <li>Products returned without authorisation</li>
    <li>Products outside the confirmed return period</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="refund-processing">
  <h2>6. Refund Processing</h2>
  <p>Approved refunds are issued to the original payment method.</p>
  <p>Banks and payment providers may require additional time to display the refund after it has been processed.</p>
  <p>Original shipping charges are refundable only where required by law or where the fulfilment error was caused by REÚ.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="return-shipping">
  <h2>7. Return Shipping</h2>
  <p>Do not send products back without receiving return instructions.</p>
  <p>Our support team will confirm:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Whether the return is eligible</li>
    <li>The correct return destination</li>
    <li>Whether a shipping label will be supplied</li>
    <li>Who is responsible for return-shipping costs</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The final return-shipping rule must be approved by the merchant before launch.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="how-to-request-a-return-or-cancellation">
  <h2>8. How to Request a Return or Cancellation</h2>
  <p>Visit the <a href="{{ pages.contact.url | default: '/pages/contact' }}">Contact page</a> and choose “Return or refund” or “Change or cancel order.”</p>
  <p>Include your order number and a clear explanation of your request.</p>
</div>
